cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this workshop, please cite it as below."
title: "Physical AI Workshop"
abstract: >
  A self-contained, 3-hour, beginner-friendly workshop covering the complete
  Physical AI pipeline end-to-end: webcam perception with MediaPipe hand
  landmarks, MuJoCo simulation with Gymnasium, reinforcement learning with
  PPO (Stable-Baselines3), teleoperation, and vision-language-action control
  with Google Gemini. Designed for ~30 participants on Windows 11 laptops.
  No GPU required.
